+# Handoff P4-2 — Data Sekolah Asal + Jurusan
+
+## Task
+- Phase: 4 | Task ID: P4-2 | Date: 2026-10-22 | Branch: `main` @ `a98defa` + uncommitted changes (P4-1 + P4-2; nothing committed by Claude)
+
+## Summary
+- Step 4 implemented with the owner's 5 fields, shared Zod validation, server action re-validation, typed draft and gating. All five wizard steps now have content; storage is still Phase 5.
+
+## Files
+### Created
+- `src/features/registration/school-schema.ts`, `src/features/registration/components/step-school.tsx`, `ai/handoff/P4-2.md`
+### Modified
+- `src/features/registration/actions.ts` (+`validateSchoolStep`), `draft.ts`, `steps.ts` (+`SCHOOL_STEP_INDEX`), `components/registration-wizard.tsx`, `components/step-review.tsx`
+- `ai/DECISIONS.md` (ADR-008 superseded, ADR-023), `CHANGELOG.md`, `ROADMAP.md`, `CURRENT_STATE.md`
+### Deleted
+- `src/features/registration/components/step-placeholder.tsx` (now unused). Temporary `src/app/qa-school` created and removed.
+
+## Verification
+- Run: typecheck, lint, build, 26 ad-hoc schema checks, SSR HTML inspection. Not run: browser interaction, signed-in server round trip, unit tests, screen reader, DB.
+
+## Decisions / risks
+- ADR-023 assumptions need school approval (three-major split, length limits, year list).
+- Jurusan has no Prisma column; parent birth year vs `birthDate` mismatch (ADR-022). Both need reviewed migrations in Phase 5.
+
+## Next task
+- Owner reviews/commits; then Phase 5 (confirmation + persistence).
